ass=\"\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>红队赛道（Bypass Challenge）</span></strong></span><span>：构造恶意 Skill，绕过主办方的多引擎扫描体系。你提交的 Skill，必须同时具备\"真正的恶意性\"和\"通过检测的隐蔽性\"——两个条件缺一不可。</span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>蓝队赛道（Detection Challenge）</span></span></strong><span>：提交你的检测引擎，用 Docker 镜像接受海量黑白灰 Skill 样本的实战检验。F₂ 评分体系偏向召回率——漏检一个恶意 Skill，比误杀一个好 Skill 代价更高。</span></p></li></ul><div style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"><img style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" src=\"https://wechat2rss.bestblogs.dev/img-proxy/?k=6a16ccdf&#x26;u=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FFGB4hYw9FedcaibBu4Rdw4lfrSZ5LqaZic0quibD0yDgtCwecRbDk2ibher7mFg4ibsIL8iaBssNnjIS86zaXBpcicicc7fLgQ8SKqVrgG7d18qF9fk%2F640%3Fwx_fmt%3Dpng%26from%3Dappmsg\"></p></div><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>大赛亮点</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ol style=\"list-style-type: decimal;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 18px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(2, 116, 255);box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span>国内首个聚焦 Skill 的安全大赛</span></strong></span></p><p sty